    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Soldier is a shooting game with a top-down perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive to the end by slaying the onslaught of zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use assault rifles, shotguns, magnums, grenade launchers, flamethrowers, and more, depending on the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the going gets tough, use support items such as bombs, sentry guns, and swords to help you get through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-understand gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global ranking</p>",
